KZ3 patch 2197: RSX_PUB=1|verify, the ordered publisher P inline on the walker thread. Every walker-thread guest signal (rsx_guest_signal.h kinds) becomes a kzr record that P retires in strict seq order at today's position with today's value; RSX_PUB_LAG=N holds records back (diagnostics); [pub] line; log-empty asserts at the call boundary, the pass end and set_movie_mode (lock-free); the report value computed once and counted; ref-queue drop-oldest kept and counted; the 2185 pending-store table's thread rule counted. Unset = the funnel's direct path, unchanged.

